{
  "_readme": [
    "Work, business & money content pack — UNVERIFIED SCAFFOLD.",
    "Registration thresholds, fees and slabs change with every budget and differ",
    "by state. Every rule seeds unverified and every fee is an estimate. Confirm",
    "against the department's own portal before publishing. See content/README.md.",
    "",
    "professional-tax is scope:\"state\" on purpose. Several large states —",
    "Uttar Pradesh, Delhi, Haryana and Rajasthan among them — do not levy it at",
    "all, and listing it nationally would send those users hunting for a",
    "registration that does not exist. Verify the availableStates list against",
    "each state's finance department before publishing."
  ],

